# https://github.com/github/gitignore

# ================ Rust ================
# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# rustc will dump stack traces when hitting an internal compiler error to PWD
rustc-ice-*.txt

# ================ Dart ================
# See https://www.dartlang.org/guides/libraries/private-files

# Files and directories created by pub
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
# If you're building an application, you may want to check-in your pubspec.lock
# 本项目 Flutter 端是应用（apps/gui），锁文件应提交以保证依赖可复现；
# 若将来新增可复用 Dart 包，请在下方按路径调整 !pubspec.lock 规则，而不要全局忽略。
# pubspec.lock

# Directory created by dartdoc
# If you don't generate documentation locally you can remove this line.
doc/api/

# dotenv environment variables file
.env*
# 环境变量模板需要提交，便于新成员按模板创建本地配置
!.env.example
!.env.sample

# Avoid committing generated Javascript files:
*.dart.js
# Produced by the --dump-info flag.
*.info.json
# When generated by dart2js. Don't specify *.js if your
# project includes source files written in JavaScript.
# 本项目 Web 端/工具脚本可能包含手写 JS，因此不全局忽略 *.js；
# 生成物仍由上方 *.dart.js、*.js.map 等精确规则覆盖。
# *.js
*.js_
*.js.deps
*.js.map

.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies

# ================ Flutter ================
# Miscellaneous
*.class
# 不忽略锁文件：Rust（Cargo.lock）与 Flutter 应用（pubspec.lock）都应提交，
# 以保证可复现构建与依赖审计。
# *.lock
!Cargo.lock
!pubspec.lock
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.buildlog/
.history



# Flutter repo-specific
/bin/cache/
/bin/internal/bootstrap.bat
/bin/internal/bootstrap.sh
/bin/mingit/
/dev/benchmarks/mega_gallery/
/dev/bots/.recipe_deps
/dev/bots/android_tools/
/dev/devicelab/ABresults*.json
